  "description": "The native payload for Agora's virtual background extension (full-virtual-background 4.6.3 on Maven Central), packaged for .NET for Android. Segments the person from the scene so the background can be blurred, replaced with an image or filled with a colour. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Android or Net.Agora.Voice.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is RtcEngine.EnableVirtualBackground in the RTC binding.",
